# Not committed: recording oracle's transitive libz-sys pin here would trip
# the libz-only-in-oracle constraint, which scans fuzz/ for "libz-sys" (it
# means fuzz's own source/Cargo.toml, but Cargo.lock necessarily lists every
# transitive dependency oracle pulls in). Regenerate with `cargo check
# --manifest-path fuzz/Cargo.toml` or `cargo fuzz run`.
/fuzz/Cargo.lock
/testdata/generated/
/testdata/corpora/archives/
/testdata/corpora/canterbury/
/testdata/corpora/silesia/
/provenance/tool-log.jsonl
/provenance/*.lock
__pycache__/
*.pyc
